# The repository root ignores __pycache__/, *.pyc, .venv, .build/, .ruff_cache/ and .pytest_cache/.
# The baseline fixture deliberately CONTAINS those, because the test proves they are not hashed;
# a nested .gitignore is the only way to keep them in the repo without touching the root rules.
!__pycache__/
!*.pyc
!.venv
!.build/
!.ruff_cache/
!.pytest_cache/
